hte-console (HTE Remote's console)
==================================

hte-console is new code written for HTE Remote (AGPL-3.0, see ../LICENSE) that answers what the CortenDesk console answered,
on the same database:

    CortenDesk, https://github.com/marcpope/cortendesk, GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.
    The modified copy of it this console was ported from (archived source): https://github.com/regendorf-ux/hte-cortendesk

Its templates (templates/), static files (assets/) and the web client (rdclient/) are derived from or copied out of
CortenDesk's views, public/assets and webclient, with HTE Remote's changes; they are covered by the AGPL-3.0 as in CortenDesk.

Third-party files under assets/, each under its own licence (the licence text sits next to the files):

  vendor/bootstrap/    Bootstrap 5.3.8, MIT License, (c) The Bootstrap Authors
  vendor/remixicon/    Remix Icon 4.8.0, Apache License 2.0, (c) Remix Design (remixicon.css is modified; its header says how)
  vendor/apexcharts/   ApexCharts 3.35.4, MIT License, (c) ApexCharts
  vendor/htmx/         htmx, BSD Zero-Clause License, (c) Big Sky Software
  fonts/figtree/       Figtree, SIL Open Font License 1.1, (c) The Figtree Project Authors

The RustDesk protocol definitions used by the web client originate from the RustDesk project (AGPL-3.0).
